<page xmlns="http://projectmallard.org/1.0/" type="task" id="manage-sessions">
  <info>
    <link type="guide" xref="index"/>
    <desc>Create, open, and continue persistent coyote sessions.</desc>
  </info>
  <title>Manage Sessions</title>
  <p>Sessions preserve conversation history and configuration so work can continue later.</p>
  <steps>
    <item><p>Choose <gui>File</gui> and then choose <gui>New Session</gui> to replace the current session.</p></item>
    <item><p>Choose <gui>File</gui> and then choose <gui>Open Session...</gui> to select a saved session.</p></item>
    <item><p>Choose <gui>View</gui> → <gui>Agents Window</gui> to show or hide the modeless agents support window. Use it to select the main agent or one of its short-lived subagents without opening another desktop window. A selected live agent receives prompts and applicable controls; completed agents remain available for review.</p></item>
    <item><p>Use <gui>File</gui> and <gui>New Window</gui> when an explicitly separate physical coyote window is needed.</p></item>
  </steps>
  <p>See <link xref="ui-menu">Main menu</link> for menu navigation and <link xref="keyboard-shortcuts">Keys &amp; Shortcuts</link> for keyboard access.</p>
</page>
